<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>Terms & Conditions - Krishna National Contest 2026</title>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e3f2fd 0%, #bbdefb 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a237e 0%, #283593 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 50px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .header h1 {
            font-size: 32px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .header p {
            font-size: 15px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 50px 50px 60px;
        }

        .content p {
            color: #37474f;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .section h3 {
            color: #1a237e;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            padding-bottom: 8px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.3);
        }

        .section ul {
            margin-left: 25px;
            color: #546e7a;
            line-height: 1.9;
        }

        .section li {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .back-btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            color: #1a237e;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.08);
            border-radius: 30px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        .back-btn:hover {
            background: rgba(26, 35, 126, 0.15);
            transform: translateX(-5px);
        }

        .footer-note {
            text-align: center;
            color: #78909c;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-top: 40px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .content, .header {
                padding: 40px 30px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 26px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {
            body {
                padding: 20px 15px;
            }

            .content, .header {
                padding: 30px 25px;
            }

            .header h1 {
                font-size: 22px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <a href="/" class="back-btn">← Back to Home</a>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
            <p>Last Updated: February 2026</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <p>
                Welcome to Krishna National Contest 2026. By participating in this contest, you agree to be bound 
                by these Terms and Conditions. Please read them carefully before registering.
            </p>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Eligibility</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>The contest is open to residents of India of all age groups</li>
                    <li>Participants under 18 must have parental or guardian consent</li>
                    <li>Registration requires a valid email address and phone number</li>
                    <li>Each participant can register for multiple contest categories</li>
                    <li>Employees and immediate family members of ISKCON are eligible to participate</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Registration & Payment</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Registration fee of ₹399 is required per contest category</li>
                    <li>Payment must be completed through our secure payment gateway</li>
                    <li>Registration is confirmed only after successful payment</li>
                    <li>Participants will receive confirmation via email and WhatsApp</li>
                    <li>Registration fees are non-transferable between contest categories</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Contest Rules</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>All submissions must be original work created by the participant</li>
                    <li>Plagiarism or copying will result in immediate disqualification</li>
                    <li>Submissions must align with devotional and cultural themes</li>
                    <li>Participants must submit entries before the stated deadline</li>
                    <li>Late submissions will not be accepted under any circumstances</li>
                    <li>The organizer's decision on winners is final and binding</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Intellectual Property</h3>
                <p>
                    By submitting your work, you grant ISKCON a non-exclusive license to use, display, and 
                    promote your submission for contest purposes and promotional activities. You retain all 
                    ownership rights to your original work.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Prizes & Awards</h3>
                <ul>
                    <li>Winners will be selected by a panel of qualified judges</li>
                    <li>Prize distribution details will be communicated to winners directly</li>
                    <li>Prizes are non-transferable and cannot be exchanged for cash</li>
                    <li>Winners must provide necessary documentation for prize collection</li>
                    <li>Tax implications on prizes are the responsibility of winners</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Liability</h3>
                <p>
                    ISKCON and Krishna National Contest organizers are not liable for any technical issues, 
                    lost submissions, or delays caused by circumstances beyond our control. We reserve the 
                    right to modify contest rules or cancel the contest if necessary.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="section">
                <h3>Contact Information</h3>
                <p>
                    For questions about these Terms & Conditions, please contact:<br>
                    <strong>Email:</strong> support@krishnacontest.org<br>
                    <strong>Phone:</strong> +91-XXXXXXXXXX
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="footer-note">
                <p>© 2026 Krishna National Contest. All Rights Reserved.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
